{"parentUuid":"acab5946-8f70-4598-8e92-1290cc5d3646","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cf82rfiYRRjt39ACQin3T","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I checked that every repo is clean and pushed after the sync. That covers 137 repos in DEV, plus the config, skills, and memory repos.\n\n**Sync (DEV root: `~/DEV`)**\n- **Config, skills, memory:** All three pulled and pushed. I committed local changes in `~/.claude` and `global-memory` first. The skills repo got 1 new skill, `research-in-5`, and I ran `sync-to-codex.sh`. Memory got no new commits.\n- **Repos:** Only `Weekly_Research_Review` was behind. I merged its 3 new commits with no conflicts. Nothing had to be cloned or created, and no `.from-*` files were made.\n- **\"Missing\" repos:** GitHub has 3 repos with no folder of the same name, but all 3 are already on the Mac:\n  - `AI_Analyst` is in `_ARCHIVE`.\n  - `AppliedPerformance-Site` is in `~/DEV/Website`.\n  - `Linda_Projects` is in `~/DEV/Linda Projects`.\n- **Activity:** 19 repos are active. The other 118 have little recent work, and all are clean.\n\n**Picking up: `sleep-scheduler`** (active repo with the newest commit)\n- **Last session:** 2026-09-16 at 18:31, done on Windows.\n- **Where things stand:** Packages 1–3 are built (calendar core, staff CSV input, one-page HTML comparison), and 210 tests pass. PR #1 is merged. The real Auburn and PVAMU baselines are on Drive. The first real candidate was rejected because post-game time cannot be cut.\n- **Blocked on:** An early-kickoff itinerary. Nights that start at release still have no earliest start time (open question 4). You also still need staff to confirm the 30-minute wind-down.\n- **Next:** Each game week, enter the itinerary CSV on Drive and run it against the 9-hour target. Build a candidate only when a night is short.\n\n**Two small problems in `sleep-scheduler/AGENTS.md`**\n- **Broken characters:** Dashes show as `â€”`. This is the Windows encoding damage you saw before.\n- **Old text:** The \"Paused design interview\" section is out of date. It also still holds an unmerged `.from-windows` block.\n\n**Three hook errors from today**\n- **`gps-pull`:** The Catapult address could not be found, which is a network error.\n- **`memsearch-sync`:** It crashed while loading `onnxruntime`.\n- **`daily-backup`:** It said `dotclaude` and `global-memory` had diverged. Both are now in sync with GitHub.\n\nDo you want to work on `sleep-scheduler`, or on something else?\n\nresult: Mac is fully synced with GitHub (1 repo merged, 0 conflicts). Next up is `sleep-scheduler`, which is waiting on an early-kickoff itinerary."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8655,"cache_read_input_tokens":85553,"output_tokens":1054,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":77},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8655,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1054,"cache_read_input_tokens":85553,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8655,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8655},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cf82rf3rdEiDQ7w5UTKJU","attributionSkill":"dev-sync","type":"assistant","uuid":"b8f207af-b2d7-4411-8754-8e85a1e7ecf1","timestamp":"2026-09-17T00:04:05.219Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"b4e73986-d9fe-48ee-8449-471485f44b0e","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/sleep-scheduler","sessionId":"b4e73986-d9fe-48ee-8449-471485f44b0e","version":"2.1.273","gitBranch":"main"}
