{"parentUuid":"24151a07-3dc3-4906-8e18-49cff20e0520","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"087e126b-996a-4039-aa74-d34f58a235be","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013CVZ9F94Gnqtxfph6Z7JfM","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/kristinarash/DEV/DataBase_GPS_Reporting/docs/STATUS.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"e978f768-c8a0-4487-a20c-be7a5b3e1078","timestamp":"2026-09-17T00:23:50.621Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/DataBase_GPS_Reporting/docs/STATUS.md","oldString":"- Check the first scheduled run after 06:30: `gps_report/logs/last_run.json` (status ok, `run_id` set) and\n  `gps_report/logs/launchd-gpspull.log`.\n- Optional follow-up: have `claude-stack-doctor` read `last_run.json` too.\n\n## Open questions","newString":"- Checked 2026-09-16: scheduled runs 09-14 and 09-15 ran clean at 06:30. 09-16 failed (exit 4,\n  NameResolution) because the Mac was asleep on battery; see Gotchas. Recovered the same day with\n  `pull.sh` by hand: 2 imported (09-15, 09-16), 3 skipped, 0 errors, coach reports built.\n- Optional follow-up: have `claude-stack-doctor` read `last_run.json` too.\n\n## Open questions\n- Keep the Mac awake at 06:30? Option: plug in overnight plus\n  `sudo pmset repeat wakeorpoweron MTWRFSU 06:28:00`. Or leave it: a lid-shut morning costs one alert\n  and the next pull (manual or next 06:30) catches up through `retry_from`. Eric's call (needs sudo).","originalFile":"# STATUS\n\n## Done\n- Repo brought under git and pushed to erash11 (2026-09-09).\n- 2026-09-13: GPS home decided (option A). This DuckDB is the one store; GD `FA2026/01_Raw_GPS`\n  is the raw mailbox. Import diagnosed: code + API work; the Windows `Refresh_All_Data` task\n  died silently since 2026-04-30 (likely `wmic` date step). Plan:\n  `docs/2026-09-13-regular-pull-plan.md`.\n\n- 2026-09-13: **regular-pull build** — Eric chose the Mac as DB owner, an automatic 06:30 launchd\n  pull plus manual `pull.sh`, and importing the mock game. Plan reviewed by Codex over 6 rounds\n  (APPROVED) and the code inspected by a fresh Codex session: `docs/2026-09-13-pull-build-PLAN.md`,\n  `docs/2026-09-13-pull-build-REVIEW-LOG.md`. `bulk_import.py --since-db`, receipts, exit codes,\n  atomic sessions, alerts, `ops/com.keystone.gpspull.plist`, macOS Chrome path for coach PDFs,\n  tests (`gps_report/tests`, `coach_report/tests`). `API_Token_FB.txt` and `*.pyc` untracked.\n\n- 2026-09-13: **pull is live.** Backup `gps_report/data/backups/gps_history_pre-backfill_2026-09-13.duckdb`\n  (SHA-256 match). Backfill `--start 2026-04-26 --end 2026-09-13`: 44 imported, 0 errors; DB 713 sessions,\n  newest 2026-09-12, mock game stored, no header without rows, all 44 listed sessions stored. Coach report\n  2026-09-12 built HTML + PDF. `pull.sh` by hand from `/tmp`: exit 0, 17 skipped, no alerts.\n  `com.keystone.gpspull` installed and bootstrapped (daily 06:30). Codex: plan APPROVED (round 6); code\n  inspected 3× (all REVISE, every finding fixed); the inspection-3 fixes and a later test-isolation fix are\n  not Codex-inspected (Eric's override).\n\n## Next\n- Done 2026-09-13, verified on Windows: the only task running `refresh_all_data.bat` is `\\Refresh_All_Data`\n  (`_INBOX` copy, GPS step REM'd). No Windows task runs `bulk_import.py`. See\n  `_INBOX/docs/handoffs/2026-09-13-windows-sync-refresh-task.md`.\n- Check the first scheduled run after 06:30: `gps_report/logs/last_run.json` (status ok, `run_id` set) and\n  `gps_report/logs/launchd-gpspull.log`.\n- Optional follow-up: have `claude-stack-doctor` read `last_run.json` too.\n\n## Open questions\n- Rotate the Catapult token (plain text in `.env`, the CLI credentials, Drive `Bearer.txt`, and git\n  history `91a233b`)? Eric's call.\n- Rewrite git history to drop `API_Token_FB.txt`? Eric's call (repo is private).\n\n---\n\n## Merged from windows copy (2026-09-11)\n\n<!-- Contents of STATUS.md.from-windows, kept verbatim so nothing is lost. Fold into the sections above when convenient. -->\n\n# STATUS\n\nRead this first. Update it before ending every session.\n\n## Current state\n- Snapshot committed 2026-09-09 during migration to the DEV + GitHub workflow.\n\n## Next\n-\n\n## Open questions\n-\n\n## Gotchas\n-\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":26,"oldLines":11,"newStart":26,"newLines":15,"lines":[" - Done 2026-09-13, verified on Windows: the only task running `refresh_all_data.bat` is `\\Refresh_All_Data`","   (`_INBOX` copy, GPS step REM'd). No Windows task runs `bulk_import.py`. See","   `_INBOX/docs/handoffs/2026-09-13-windows-sync-refresh-task.md`.","-- Check the first scheduled run after 06:30: `gps_report/logs/last_run.json` (status ok, `run_id` set) and","-  `gps_report/logs/launchd-gpspull.log`.","+- Checked 2026-09-16: scheduled runs 09-14 and 09-15 ran clean at 06:30. 09-16 failed (exit 4,","+  NameResolution) because the Mac was asleep on battery; see Gotchas. Recovered the same day with","+  `pull.sh` by hand: 2 imported (09-15, 09-16), 3 skipped, 0 errors, coach reports built."," - Optional follow-up: have `claude-stack-doctor` read `last_run.json` too."," "," ## Open questions","+- Keep the Mac awake at 06:30? Option: plug in overnight plus","+  `sudo pmset repeat wakeorpoweron MTWRFSU 06:28:00`. Or leave it: a lid-shut morning costs one alert","+  and the next pull (manual or next 06:30) catches up through `retry_from`. Eric's call (needs sudo)."," - Rotate the Catapult token (plain text in `.env`, the CLI credentials, Drive `Bearer.txt`, and git","   history `91a233b`)? Eric's call."," - Rewrite git history to drop `API_Token_FB.txt`? Eric's call (repo is private)."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"24151a07-3dc3-4906-8e18-49cff20e0520","session_id":"b4e73986-d9fe-48ee-8449-471485f44b0e","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/DataBase_GPS_Reporti