lug in overnight plus\n  `sudo pmset repeat wakeorpoweron MTWRFSU 06:28:00`. Or leave it: a lid-shut morning costs one alert\n  and the next pull (manual or next 06:30) catches up through `retry_from`. Eric's call (needs sudo).\n- Rotate the Catapult token (plain text in `.env`, the CLI credentials, Drive `Bearer.txt`, and git\n  history `91a233b`)? Eric's call.\n- Rewrite git history to drop `API_Token_FB.txt`? Eric's call (repo is private).\n\n---\n\n## Merged from windows copy (2026-09-11)\n\n<!-- Contents of STATUS.md.from-windows, kept verbatim so nothing is lost. Fold into the sections above when convenient. -->\n\n# STATUS\n\nRead this first. Update it before ending every session.\n\n## Current state\n- Snapshot committed 2026-09-09 during migration to the DEV + GitHub workflow.\n\n## Next\n-\n\n## Open questions\n-\n\n## Gotchas\n-\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":39,"oldLines":6,"newStart":39,"newLines":17,"lines":["   history `91a233b`)? Eric's call."," - Rewrite git history to drop `API_Token_FB.txt`? Eric's call (repo is private)."," ","+## Gotchas","+- **A NameResolution / \"Can't assign requested address\" error at 06:30 usually means the Mac was asleep,","+  not that Catapult or DNS is down.** On battery, launchd runs the missed 06:30 job during a 2-second","+  DarkWake (a brief background wake with no usable Wi-Fi). The process then freezes between wakes, and","+  the 2/4/8s retries all land in one dead window. 2026-09-16: started 06:48, failed 07:24, Wi-Fi","+  `E_CONNECTION_LOSS` at 07:07. Confirm with `pmset -g log | grep -E \"DarkWake|Sleep \"` around the run","+  time, then just rerun `pull.sh`. Do not lengthen the API client's backoff; it would freeze across","+  sleeps too and delay real-outage alerts.","+- A manual catch-up run also writes a `stale` alert line first (it checks the 36 h gap before importing).","+  That line is expected when recovering from a missed morning.","+"," ---"," "," ## Merged from windows copy (2026-09-11)"]}],"userM