{"parentUuid":"11b3b14f-3a5b-48f3-8c75-07a1b874918c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cf84x3GxdbLd3pMEcvSMp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Closeout — 2026-09-16\n\nI checked every repo again at the end. All DEV repos and all three config repos are clean and pushed. The error log is empty.\n\n**Committed & pushed:**\n- **`sleep-scheduler`:** Fixed the broken dashes (`734856d`). Removed the old `.from-windows` block (`110f295`).\n- **`DataBase_GPS_Reporting`:** Wrote down the sleep cause in STATUS (`9ae7f5d`). Removed the empty `.from-windows` block (`63dc43d`).\n- **`~/.claude`:** Fixed the memsearch hook (`2ed1e54`), plus the usual session snapshot.\n- **`~/.claude/global-memory`:** Handoff, the GPS memory line, and the error log archive. Windows had also written today's transcript. I kept both sides (merge `764532b`).\n- **`Weekly_Research_Review`:** Pulled in 4 more commits from Windows. There was nothing to push.\n\n**STATUS.md:** Updated in `sleep-scheduler` and `DataBase_GPS_Reporting`.\n\n**Memory:** Saved.\n- `.errors.log`: All 5 lines were explained and fixed. I moved them to `~/.claude/global-memory/transcripts/errors-archive-2026-09-16.log`, and the log is now empty.\n- `MEMORY.md`: The GPS line now shows the open wake-up decision (2,445 of 2,500 characters).\n- Repo docs were copied into memory search (138 repos).\n\n**Handoff:** `~/.claude/global-memory/handoffs/2026-09-16-mac-sync-and-hook-fixes.md`\n\n**Other files changed:**\n- `~/.codex/hooks/memsearch-sync.js` (a link to the Claude hook, so it has the fix)\n- `~/DEV/DataBase_GPS_Reporting/coach_report/Reports/coach/2026-09-15/` and `.../2026-09-16/`: coach reports (HTML and PDF), not tracked in git\n- `~/DEV/DataBase_GPS_Reporting/gps_report/data/gps_history.duckdb`: 2 new sessions, not tracked in git\n\n**Still open:**\n1. Decide whether the Mac wakes for the 06:30 GPS pull. If yes, leave it plugged in overnight and run `! sudo pmset repeat wakeorpoweron MTWRFSU 06:28:00`.\n2. Rotate the Catapult token. This was already open before today.\n\nClear to sign off.\n\nresult: Closeout is done. Every repo and the memory repo are pushed, the error log is clear, and the handoff is saved. The only open items are the Mac wake-up choice and the Catapult token rotation."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":485,"cache_read_input_tokens":168386,"output_tokens":968,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":37},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":485,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":968,"cache_read_input_tokens":168386,"cache_creation_input_tokens":485,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":485},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cf84x2PNa4PKMMztr5SXz","attributionSkill":"closeout","type":"assistant","uuid":"fe2b74a4-0bfd-4eef-9287-d0dd585c928a","timestamp":"2026-09-17T00:31:29.953Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"b4e73986-d9fe-48ee-8449-471485f44b0e","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"b4e73986-d9fe-48ee-8449-471485f44b0e","version":"2.1.273","gitBranch":"main"}
