ion","+","+- `C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\.claude\\docs\\STATUS.md`","+- `C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\.claude\\claude-memory-compiler\\uv.lock`","+- `C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\.claude\\claude-memory-compiler\\docs\\STATUS.md`","+- `C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\.claude\\claude-memory-compiler\\knowledge\\concepts\\deep-research-partial-output-salvage.md`","+- `C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\.claude\\claude-memory-compiler\\knowledge\\concepts\\facecomps-practice-faces-workbook.md`","+- `C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\.claude\\global-memory\\transcripts\\2026-09-14.md`","+- `C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\.claude\\global-memory\\transcripts\\.errors.log`","+- `C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\.claude\\global-memory\\docs\\STATUS.md`","+- Live Claude session JSONL and hook-result files under `C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\.claude\\projects\\` are committed as the configuration-repo transcript snapshot; their exact tracked paths are recorded by that commit.","+","+## Next actions","+","+1. Eric rotates the historical VALD credential and confirms the replacement stays outside Git and documentation.","+2. Eric reviews `Ath_Medicine`, `Baylor_Exposure_Data`, and `Risk_Stratification_Engine` for identifiable athlete/health data.","+3. Eric performs the deferred deletion of retained scratch, duplicate, and migrated-storage folders when satisfied with the backups.","+4. On the Mac, pull `~/.claude/skills` and run the guarded `sync-to-codex.sh`.","+5. Clone or otherwise restore SecondBrain to the configured Windows location only if Windows vault-backed skills are needed.","+","+## Open questions","+","+- Has the historical VALD credential been revoked and replaced?","+- Should SecondBrain remain Mac-only or be restored to Windows?","+- `LibraryProject.code-workspace` still names a nonexistent nested `SportScienceResearchRepo`; the live repo is at the DEV root."]}],"created":true}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/kristinarash/DEV/COMMANDS.md","/Users/kristinarash/DEV/RESEARCH.md","/Users/kristinarash/DEV/docs/STATUS.md","/Users/kristinaras