{"parentUuid":"eeeaae66-7941-43ce-ad4e-afa3bc124c49","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cf87aUx2Nojjh8nU89zrf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":586,"cache_read_input_tokens":200793,"output_tokens":933,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":49},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":586,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":933,"cache_read_input_tokens":200793,"cache_creation_input_tokens":586,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":586},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cf87aUEcayVyoBVAZMyay","type":"assistant","uuid":"e8f16235-6d33-4660-8bdf-232b80ab8c29","timestamp":"2026-09-17T01:05:57.640Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"b4e73986-d9fe-48ee-8449-471485f44b0e","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"b4e73986-d9fe-48ee-8449-471485f44b0e","version":"2.1.273","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"e8f16235-6d33-4660-8bdf-232b80ab8c29","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cf87aUx2Nojjh8nU89zrf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Closeout — 2026-09-16 (late)\n\nI checked every repo at the end. All DEV repos, the three config repos, and the `~/DEV` root repo are clean and in step with GitHub.\n\n**Committed & pushed:**\n- **`~/.claude`:**\n  - `df98f8c`: added `Weekly_Research_Review` to the backup manifest as institutional.\n  - A closeout snapshot, merged with 2 new commits from Windows.\n- **`~/.claude/global-memory`:** Handoff update and copied repo docs (138 repos). It merged 2 Windows commits with no conflicts.\n- **`~/DEV` root:** Pulled 5 commits from Windows, including the router row for `Weekly_Research_Review`. There was nothing to push.\n- **DEV project repos:** No new changes since the last closeout.\n\n**STATUS.md:** No repo changed since the last closeout, so none needed an update.\n\n**Memory:** Saved. `.errors.log` still has 2 `daily-backup` lines, and I did not clear them. The backup rule says to clear only after a clean run, and the last run was not clean.\n\n**Handoff:** Updated `~/.claude/global-memory/handoffs/2026-09-16-mac-sync-and-hook-fixes.md`\n\n**Backup:**\n- **Run 1:** 86 jobs, SSD included. Error: `Weekly_Research_Review` had no class. You picked institutional, and that error is fixed.\n- **Run 2:** 87 jobs, SSD included. New error: `snapshot-ssd:.codex`. The ChatGPT/Codex app deleted its temp database files while rsync was copying them. Everything else was saved.\n\n**Still open:**\n1. **Backup `.codex` error.** Close the ChatGPT app, then run `/backup` again. It should pass, and then the error lines can be archived. If the error comes back, change the script to skip those temp files.\n2. **Mac wake-up for the 06:30 GPS pull.** Plug the Mac in overnight and run `! sudo pmset repeat wakeorpoweron MTWRFSU 06:28:00`, or accept one alert on mornings when the lid is shut.\n3. **Rotate the Catapult token.** This was already open before today.\n\nClear to sign off. Everything is pushed. The backup error does not block signing off: all your work is on GitHub and the SSD.\n\nresult: Closeout done and everything is pushed. `Weekly_Research_Review` is now in the backup manifest as institutional. One backup error is left: `.codex` failed because the ChatGPT app was using the files. Close that app and run `/backup` again to clear it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":586,"cache_read_input_tokens":200793,"output_tokens":933,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":49},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":586,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":933,"cache_read_input_tokens":200793,"cache_creation_input_tokens":586,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":586},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cf87aUEcayVyoBVAZMyay","type":"assistant","uuid":"08481f1e-7b85-400a-a50f-58ca14a9606a","timestamp":"2026-09-17T01:05:58.349Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"b4e73986-d9fe-48ee-8449-471485f44b0e","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"b4e73986-d9fe-48ee-8449-471485f44b0e","version":"2.1.273","gitBranch":"main"}
